{
  "key": 25630,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_IdLikeYouToHaveThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}…\r",
        "Your Pokédex quest is one that\n",
        "requires strong dedication.\r",
        "Without deep love for Pokémon,\n",
        "your quest may fail.\r",
        "I’m not sure if this will help you,\n",
        "but I’d like you to have it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_ReceivedPokeFluteFromMrFuji",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received a Poké Flute\n",
        "from Mr. Fuji."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_ExplainPokeFlute",
      "en_US": [
        "Upon hearing the Poké Flute,\n",
        "sleeping Pokémon will spring awake.\r",
        "Try using it on Pokémon that are\n",
        "sleeping obstacles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_FujiSomethingElse",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: There is one more thing.\r",
        "When I cared for the orphans up in\n",
        "the Tower, I carried a charm to\f",
        "keep the wild Pokémon away.\r",
        "It is called the Spirit Ward. It\n",
        "never wears out. I can hold it up,\f",
        "or put it away, as I please.\r",
        "But it is not a thing to give\n",
        "lightly. You must earn it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_Nidorino",
      "en_US": "Nidorino: Gaoo!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_Psyduck",
      "en_US": "Psyduck: Gwappa!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MonsNiceToHug",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s so warm!\n",
        "Pokémon are so nice to hug."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_WhereDidMrFujiGo",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s odd, Mr. Fuji isn’t here.\n",
        "Where’d he go?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MrFujiLooksAfterOrphanedMons",
      "en_US": [
        "This is really Mr. Fuji’s house.\r",
        "He’s really kind.\r",
        "He looks after abandoned and\n",
        "orphaned Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_GrandPrizeDrawingClipped",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Fan Magazine\n",
        "Monthly Grand Prize Drawing!\r",
        "The application form is…\r",
        "Gone! It’s been clipped out.\n",
        "Someone must have applied already."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_PokemonMagazinesLineShelf",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon magazines line the shelf.\r",
        "Pokémon Insider…\r",
        "Pokémon Fan…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_FujiStillWaiting",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: The Spirit Ward is still\n",
        "waiting for its next keeper."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MustMakeRoomForThis",
      "en_US": "You must make room for this!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_FujiAskBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Show me how you and your Pokémon\n",
        "stand together. Will you battle\f",
        "an old man?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_FujiBattleIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: These Pokémon watch over\n",
        "the little ones here. They will not\f",
        "go easy on you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_FujiWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: Your Pokémon fought for\n",
        "you, and you fought for them.\r",
        "That is all the Spirit Ward has\n",
        "ever asked of its keeper."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_ExplainSpiritWard",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold it up, and wild Pokémon weaker\n",
        "than your lead will stay away.\r",
        "Put it away when you want to meet\n",
        "them again. It never runs out.\r",
        "You’ll find it with your Tools. You\n",
        "can register it to Select, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MrFujiWasPrayingForCubonesMother",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji had been praying alone\n",
        "for Cubone’s mother."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_HasPokeFluteHelpedYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: Has my Poké Flute\n",
        "helped you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_FujiLater",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: Whenever you are ready.\n",
        "I am not going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_FujiLost",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Fuji: Not yet, I think.\r",
        "Let me tend to your Pokémon. Come\n",
        "back when you are ready."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0478_T05R0201_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
